  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover our Classic Canvas Messenger Bag, a heavy-duty storage solution ideal for daily commutes and travel. Designed to meet your versatile needs, this military messenger bag is Jack Bauer approved! The main compartment provides ample room for storing books, folders, tablets, a small laptop, and other everyday carry items.</p>",
