  "description": "<p>Discover our Classic Canvas Messenger Bag, a heavy-duty storage solution ideal for daily commutes and travel. Designed to meet your versatile needs, this military messenger bag is Jack Bauer approved! The main compartment provides ample room for storing books, folders, tablets, a small laptop, and other everyday carry items. Adjustable Shoulder Strap: Our heavy-duty canvas messenger bags come equipped with an adjustable shoulder strap. The adjustable strap with brass fittings adjusts up to 52&rdquo; for multiple carry options and can be worn across your body, shoulders, or a variety of other ways that best suits your style. Multiple Pockets for Extra Storage: In addition to a main compartment that measures 15&rdquo; x 11&rdquo; x 6&rdquo;, our bags feature 5 additional pockets for storing supplies, such as laptop accessories, phone chargers, water bottles, writing utensils, and many more. The internal zipper pocket is great for holding desirable or small items, while the other external front and side snap-closure pockets are perfect for frequently used stuff. Hook &amp; Loop Front Closure: Stay worry-free about the contents inside your Classic Canvas Messenger Bag as they&rsquo;ll remain safe and secure within the large hook and loop flap closure. In addition, the flap closure features two canvas loops, allowing you to attach other gear while you travel. Durable Material Construction: These heavy-duty messenger bags consist of double stitched cotton canvas material that&rsquo;ll withstand constant use. The incorporated finished brass hardware provides added strength while emulating a time-less look and feel.</p>",
